          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.768,
            0.723,
            0.822
          ],
          "content": "**Remember that in all the above cases the laws of reflection are followed. At the point of incidence, the incident ray is reflected in such a way that the angle of reflection equals the angle of incidence.**"
        },
        {
